      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>OBJECTIVE:</b> Survive in the arena avoiding all hazardous balls.\n\n<b>CONTROLS:</b>\n\u2022 Move: WASD / Left Stick      \u2022 Dash: Left Shift / Gamepad B\n\u2022 Dimension Phase: Space / Gamepad A   \u2022 Slow Motion: E / Gamepad Y\n\n<b>CAMERA CONTROLS:</b>\n\u2022 Drag Right Mouse / Right Stick to orbit view.\n\u2022 Scroll Wheel / Bumpers (LB/RB) to zoom.\n\u2022 Press Home / Double-click to reset camera.\n\n<b>HAZARD BALLS:</b>\n\u2022 <color=#FF5500>Fire Ball</color>: Leaves burning tiles.  \u2022 <color=#22DD22>Sticky Ball</color>: Leaves slow goo.\n\u2022 <color=#00AAFF>Gun Ball</color>: Aims & shoots."
